  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><br></b></p><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></b><p><br></p></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">올해 처음으로 해보았는데요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교과서가 정말 가벼워진데다 수행평가 배점이 늘어나 한번 도전해보게 되었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">------</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">목표</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">마찰전기와 정전기유도를 보여주는 실험을 시연하고 원리 설명하기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정전기 현상 수업</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수행평가 예고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 1</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주일동안 정전기와 정전기유도현상을 보여주는 실험 각자 조사해오기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>2</strong></span>차시<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정전기유도 현상 수업</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">차시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">검전기 간단하게 수업</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span>조사한 것 검사<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span>개별점수 반영<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">), (</span>검사하는 동안 아이들은 학습지 풀었습니다<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span>각자 조사한 것을 토대로 조별로 실험 선정 회의 및 준비물 체크<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span>약 <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20</span>분 정도<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>4</strong></span>차시<strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span>조별로 준비한 실험 연습하기<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span>발표준비하기 <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span>부족한 부분은 점심시간에 과학실에 와서 보충하기<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>5</strong></span>차시<strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span>실험시연 및 발표<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span>평가</strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">------</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이런 과정으로 수업이 진행되었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일주일에 두 번 수업이어서 총 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2.5</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주 걸렸습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993BF24A5CFDED0327\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"262\" height=\"292\" style=\"width: 262px; height: 292px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190610_105345.jpg\"  id=\"A_993BF24A5CFDED032700C4\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996FA84A5CFDED0727\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"282\" height=\"181\" style=\"width: 282px; height: 181px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190603_110222.jpg\"  id=\"A_996FA84A5CFDED072769FB\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999CC34A5CFDED0925\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"280\" height=\"170\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 170px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190603_110334.jpg\"  id=\"A_999CC34A5CFDED0925A650\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E1524A5CFDED0B22\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"230\" height=\"220\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 220px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"576\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190603_111038.jpg\"  id=\"A_99E1524A5CFDED0B22B919\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아이들 반응은 일단 재미있었다 절반</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">실험이 생각되로 되지 않아 어려웠다는 응답 절반이었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">저는 준비하면서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전자가 어디로 가요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?’ ‘</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">여기 여기는 어떤 전기로 대전되요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?’ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이런 질문들이 나오는게 좋았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이해하려고 노력하고 알아가는 것</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">안되는 실험 되게 하려고 머리짜는 모습이 참 기특했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그리고 실험을 성공시키며 환호를 지르는 아이들을 보는 것도 기분 좋은 일이었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생각해볼 점은 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1. 반별 편차가 크다는 것이에요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">어떤 반은 조별로 비슷한 실험</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">풍선으로 종이조각 끌어당기기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">셀로판지 끌어당기기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">빗으로 끌어당기기 등</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 많아서 조금 아쉬웠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그에 비해 어떤 반은 간이검전기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정전기장구</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">불켜기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">물휘기 등이 골고루 나와서 서로들 신기해했구요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. 1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시간동안 실험 및 발표준비가 생각보다 시간이 짧네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">준비한 것이 뜻대로 되지 않는 조는 다시 준비해야 해서 발표에 어려움이 있었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">내년에는... ?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1. 실험이 겹치지 않게 하기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">반별 편차</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">난이도 조절</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">조별 실험 제목 미리 발표해서 조정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">2. 시간배분</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수업 중 짜투리시간을 활용해서 실험 연습 및 준비시간 좀 더 주기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></p><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선생님들께 공유하여 더 좋은 수업으로 다듬고 싶어서 부족하나마 올립니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.^^</span></span></p><p><br></p></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D489%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20190610145030&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile252.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99A6AE4F5CFDEF7428158D')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 마찰전기 발표 수행안내.hwp</a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D489%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20190610145030&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile283.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F995DCD4F5CFDEF791F0C98')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 마찰전기랑 정전기유도를 보여줄게 수행 개별과제.hwp</a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 1